SDL-E1056 (spec/access.md)

  x access secret key material may not be committed: a symmetric (`HS256`) verify key is secret material — write `key: '[REDACTED]';`
   ,----
 1 | access sso { on: root; type: jwt; algorithm: hs256; key: 'real_secret'; };
   :                                                     ^|^
   :                                                      `-- this key slot takes only `'[REDACTED]'`
   `----
  help: write the literal `key: '[REDACTED]';` in SDL and provision the real secret outside SDL (this access class is run manually, so its secrets are never committed); asymmetric verify keys are
        public and stay authorable
